vyges-sim is a reproducible container packaging of Verilator (Apache-2.0 / LGPL-3.0)
and cocotb (BSD-3-Clause), installed unmodified from their distributions, for
producing VCD/FST simulation activity and running cocotb testbenches. The Vyges
packaging, pinning, tool descriptor, and validation are Apache-2.0.
